### telemetry 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "speed": 65.5,
  "rpm": 2100,
  "batteryLevel": 78,
  "temperature": 32.5,
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.978,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-30T11:25:38"
}

### 없는 차량의 telemetry 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 9999999,
  "speed": 65.5,
  "rpm": 2100,
  "batteryLevel": 78,
  "temperature": 32.5,
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.978,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-29T21:26:59"
}

### telemetry 단건 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/telemetry/1

### 존재하지 않는 telemetry 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/telemetry/9999999

### 차량의 telemetry 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/1/telemetry

### 차량의 telemetry 목록 조회2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/1/telemetry?page=0&size=10&sort=id,desc

### 없는 차량의 telemetry 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/9999999/telemetry

### 차량의 최근 telemetry 조회 (정상)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/1/telemetry/latest

### 차량의 최근 telemetry 조회 (텔레메트리 없는경우)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/2/telemetry/latest

### 없는 차량의 최근 telemetry 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/vehicles/9999999/telemetry/latest

### 음수 속도
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "speed": -10,
  "rpm": 2100,
  "batteryLevel": 78,
  "temperature": 32.5,
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.978,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-30T11:30:17"
}

### null 속도
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "speed": null,
  "rpm": 2100,
  "batteryLevel": 78,
  "temperature": 32.5,
  "latitude": 37.5665,
  "longitude": 126.978,
  "timestamp": "2026-10-30T11:30:17"
}